# EAS project-archive ignores. This file exists so cloud builds can include the
# tunnel's prebuilt native cores — the iOS PounceTunnelCore.xcframework (412MB,
# build-ios.sh) and the Android jniLibs .so per ABI (build-android.sh) — both of
# which are gitignored and would be dropped by git-based packing. The exclusions
# below are deliberately anchored, so `apps/mobile/android` drops the prebuild
# output WITHOUT touching modules/pounce-tunnel/android. Used with EAS_NO_VCS=1.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.expo
apps/tunnel/target
# Exclude the local prebuild output entirely: with ios/ present EAS treats the
# project as bare workflow (rejecting runtimeVersion policies) — cloud prebuild
# regenerates it and autolinks modules/pounce-tunnel like builds 1-16 did.
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
desktop/macos/build
desktop/windows/build
desktop/node_modules
**/DerivedData
**/*.log
